@Mohamedour7 @FlutterNFriends @flutterflow @FlutterDev It’s test bundling + isolate parallelism (not caching)

Bundling: Consolidates test files so the VM &amp; widget bindings boot once instead of per-file 

Isolates (--faster): Splits tests into balanced shard bundles and runs them concurrently across worker isolates
